Java Code to find all perfect numbers (both odd and even) less than 1000:
```java
public class PerfectNumbers {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        for (int i = 1; i < 1000; i++) {
            if (isPerfect(i)) {
                System.out.println(i);
            }
        }
    }

    static boolean isPerfect(int num) {
        int sum = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i < num; i++) {
            if (num % i == 0) {
                sum += i;
            }
        }
        return sum == num;
    }
}
```

